<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issues were</p>
<p>announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 1.5 BILLION STG</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2002</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 PCT</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: MAY 20</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 1.5 BILLION STG</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2021</p>
<p>COUPON: 8.0 PCT</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: MAY 22</p>
<p>NOTES: Both issues will be fully paid and fungible with relevant stocks already in issue and will be strippable when an official gilts strips facility is introduced.</p>
<p>Interest on both stocks will be payable on June 7 and December 7.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
